# Reference illustration — DEPLOYMENT-ROOT secrets for the nested topology.
#
# In nested mode the real per-tenant secrets live in repos/<owner>/<repo>/.env
# (one GH_TOKEN + provider key each). This root file holds only what the
# SUPERVISOR itself needs: a token to install the shared git credential helper
# and to check the engine out. It is scrubbed out of every tenant child's env
# (#61), so it is never the token a tenant pushes with — each tenant uses its own.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; only this `.example` is tracked.

# --- Required (supervisor: shared git credential helper + engine checkout) ---
GH_TOKEN=

# --- Fleet knobs (optional) ---
# Cap on concurrent work units across ALL tenants. 1 ⇒ tenants take turns.
# PHOEBE_MAX_CONCURRENT_AGENTS=1
# How often boot re-scans tenants + the shared engine ref.
# PHOEBE_RECONCILE_INTERVAL_MS=60000
